Responsible operator: gamelauncher
Privacy and complaints: gamelauncher223@gmail.com

What we use and why
Your chosen display name is saved on this phone and shown to approved room members. A nickname is enough. Room names, member names, local network addresses and timing information let nearby devices discover, connect and play together. Microphone or app audio is processed when you start sharing, to play it on the selected devices. Audio may identify people or contain private information. Share only audio you are entitled to share.

Who receives it
Approved room devices receive room/member names and shared audio through encrypted connections after both people compare and confirm the security code. Discovery reveals a room code and connection address on the local network, but no username or audio. The app has no advertising, analytics or cloud audio service. Recipients can hear or independently record audio; leaving cannot recall what they already heard.

Storage and deletion
Audio is temporarily buffered in memory for playback; the app does not save audio recordings. Room information is cleared when you leave. Your display name and the notice version, acceptance time and eligibility choice stay in private app storage until you withdraw and delete. Guardian approvals and a random approval-request reference are also stored locally when used. App backup is disabled. Privacy requests sent to gamelauncher are handled separately; legally required records may have to be retained and the operator must explain applicable retention.

Your choice
Accepting allows these uses for nearby audio rooms. You can decline and exit. Stop sharing or leave a room at any time. Privacy & your data lets you withdraw consent and delete local profile/consent data; this ends sharing and disconnects this device. Rejoining requires consent again. Android microphone/sharing permission is requested separately.

Children and lawful guardians
Anyone under 18, or anyone whose consent must be given by a lawful guardian, needs verified guardian approval before entering. A parent or lawful guardian must contact gamelauncher, complete identity/adulthood and relationship/authority verification, review this notice and give consent. The app accepts an operator-signed approval for this phone and this notice. Do not email identity documents, passwords or financial information; ask for the operator's secure verification process. A guardian can withdraw on this phone immediately. Offline approvals cannot be remotely revoked; contact gamelauncher and delete the approval on this phone when withdrawing. Approvals expire and require renewal.

Rights and complaints
View your local data on this screen, correct your display name in Profile, or withdraw and delete. Email gamelauncher for access to processing/sharing information, correction, erasure, guardian withdrawal, or nomination of someone to exercise your rights in the event of death or incapacity. Proportionate verification may be required. An email draft is not a submitted request; send it in your email app. Our service policy is acknowledgement within 7 days and resolution within 30 days. If unresolved after this process, you may approach the Data Protection Board when the applicable mechanism and provisions are in force. Official information: https://www.meity.gov.in/data-protection-framework''';
